<title>BELGIUM: CMB SELLS OIL PRODUCTS VESSEL.</title>
<headline>CMB SELLS OIL PRODUCTS VESSEL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian shipping group CMB has sold its oil products vessel the &quot;Lion&quot;, company spokesman Frank Geerts confirmed on Monday.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. Geerts declined to confirm a report the vessel was sold for $19 million.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
